title: Rotfrontkämpferbund
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: reichsbanner_timer = 0
card-image: img/reichsbanner.jpg
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; reichsbanner_timer +=6; rfb_militarization_cost = 2 if rfb_militancy > 0.1 else rfb_militarization_cost = 1; rfb_militarization_cost = 3 if rfb_militancy > 0.25
max-visits: 6
#subtitle: Paramilitary organizing in defense of the republic.

= Rotfrontkämpferbund

The *Rotfrontkämpferbund* is our self-defense organization and paramilitary. It defends us against attack by the rightwing paramilitaries and competes with the reichsbanner over the left.

[? if workers_kpd > 46 :  Having become the dominant party among workers, even over the SPD, we will have a much easier time recruiting. ?]

- @militant: Fund more military-style training and equipment for the Rotfrontkämpferbund.
- @militant_2: Use our existing resources to support more training for the Rotfrontkämpferbund.
- @same: Keep the Rotfrontkämpferbund as it is.
- @cut_rfb: Cut funding for the Rotfrontkämpferbund.
- @rfmb
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

#- Orient reichsbanner towards anti-fascism (only available if we have prioritized anti fascism)

@militant
choose-if: resources >= rfb_militarization_cost
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources ([+ rfb_militarization_cost +] needed).
subtitle: -[+ rfb_militarization_cost +] resources
on-arrival: resources -= rfb_militarization_cost; rfb_investment += 1; rfb_strength += 100; rfb_militancy += 0.05; workers_kpd += 2*(1-dissent); unemployed_kpd += 2*(1-dissent); rotfrontkampferbund_funded += 1

We have increased training and arms for the Rotfrontkämpferbund. It is an increasingly powerful force among the paramilitaries, although the other parties are horrified.


@militant_2
view-if: funded_rotfrontkampferbund >= 1
on-arrival: rfb_militancy += 0.02; funded_rotfrontkampferbund -= 1

As we have already funded resources towards the Rotfrontkämpferbund, we can invest in building up their militancy.


@same

The Rotfrontkämpferbund is already serving the purpose it needs to serve. There is no reason to change what already works.

- @return: Continue...


@cut_rfb
subtitle: +1 resources
on-arrival: resources += 1; rfb_strength -= 100; rfb_militancy -= 0.05; rfb_militancy -= 0.05; workers_spd += 2; unemployed_spd += 2

Cutting resources to the Rotfrontkämpferbund causes a drop in the membership, and leads some would-be members to join the Reichsbanner instead.


@rfmb
title: Expand our women's branch, the Roter Frauen und Mädchen Bund.
subtitle: -1 resources - This might cause a backlash from existing members.
choose-if: resources > 0
view-if: womens_rights >= 4 and sender_advisor == 1 and iron_front_formed == 1
on-arrival: resources -= 1; rfb_strength += 10; funded_rotfrontkampferbund -= 1
max-visits: 1
achievement: women_reichsbanner

We are one of the few parties advocating for women's rights and we are effectively the only one to allow women into their paramilitary.

After allowing women to join, the number of comrades who leave is more than balanced out by the number of radicalized women and others who join. However, many of our departed members were veterans, and many of the new members have no experience with military-style training.

@homosexual
achievement: anders_als_die_andern
